        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-056-source-traceability>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-056-specimen-match> ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-31-t1917-056-on-the-theory-of-transformatio-audit-v2-thompson1917-t1917-056-1>,
